nodes.definition:
Information related to the type and number of people impacted or affected by the crisis in one or several sectors. People Affected includes all those whose lives have been impacted as a direct result of the shock/event. Characteristics of the category People Affected must include:
- Being in close geographical proximity to a crisis,
- Being physically or emotionally impacted, including exposed to a human rights violation/protection incident;
- Experiencing personal damage or loss of capital and assets as a direct result of the crisis (family member, house/roof, livestock or any other asset);
- Experiencing changes in behavior, belief, use of goods and services or knowledge, ability to move or legal status;
Being faced with an immediate threat from a crisis.
